Package: voiremote
Title: Run the voi Package on UBC ModelsCloud
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Ramin", "Rezaeianzadeh", email = "raminrzn@student.ubc.ca",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Remote versions of the value of information functions in the voi
    package (Jackson et al., <https://chjackson.github.io/voi/>). Each
    function, such as evppi_remote(), takes the same arguments as its voi
    counterpart, runs the calculation on UBC ModelsCloud and returns the same
    R object, so methods needing INLA or JAGS can be used without installing
    them. Requires a ModelsCloud Access Key.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports: curl, jsonlite, voi
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), voipexa, withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/raminrzn/voiremote
